      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Instantiated is a different fact from declared",
      "prov:value": "> only the instiatiated harnesses (not all dependent ones) in teh folio"
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-6",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "proposal",
      "cat-harness:section": "Instantiated is a different fact from declared",
      "prov:value": "Issue #1719.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "#1719"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-7",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Inline, over a legacy import while one remains",
      "prov:value": "`readHarnessConfig(dir)`\nreturns it for any instance that an index lists, walking outward from the\ninstance root and stopping at the first directory that holds either the index\nor the instance's own config. An instance the index does not list is read\nexactly as before."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-8",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Local or remote",
      "prov:value": "It **reuses** `RemoteMountSchema`\n  instead of restating it, so it has `ref` (not `pin`), `overrides.<name>.whole`\n  and `.path`, `note` and `trust.consent`, and every field a later change adds\n  there (such as `track`) arrives with no edit here."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-9",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Local or remote",
      "prov:value": "Nothing\n  writes `remoteMounts` on a declaration any more."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-10",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Which harness `/` is",
      "prov:value": "The owner's 2026-10-02 ruling still holds where no index exists: *\"If exactly\none harness is instantiated, it is the landing page and no flag is needed …\nIf there are several and none is flagged, a gate fails.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-02"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-11",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Which harness `/` is",
      "prov:value": "Under the\n  old rule that config instantiates a harness and under the index it does not,\n  and nothing should pick between them silently."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-12",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A harnessed repository runs its checks on its own pull requests",
      "prov:value": "**Owner, 2026-10-14:** \"There should be CI running\", through **one** reusable\nworkflow the harness owns, never a copy per repository.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-13",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "A harnessed repository runs its checks on its own pull requests",
      "prov:value": "**Owner, 2026-10-14:** \"There should be CI running\", through **one** reusable\nworkflow the harness owns, never a copy per repository. Before this ruling,\nseven layers were judged by nothing until an index re-pinned them: the\n2026-10-06 \"defined, not run on events\" ruling for the WHO forks switched off\ntheir harness gates along with their IG builds, and no initialization step\nturned the gates back on.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-14",
        "2026-10-06"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-06",
        "2026-10-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-14",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "A harnessed repository runs its checks on its own pull requests",
      "prov:value": "Each is named\n  `<owning-instance>:<script>`. **Owner, 2026-10-14:** \"A harnessed repo should\n  run not just core but all of the checks in the dependency harness.\"",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-15",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "A harnessed repository runs its checks on its own pull requests",
      "prov:value": "Read those two as\nexpected when they are the only new failures, and run them green in the\nindex re-pin instead (2026-10-23, a layer PR that added an IG AST viewer).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-23"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-23"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-16",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The exemptions of the index's own workflows",
      "prov:value": "They land in the same change as the workflow\nstep, never ahead of it in a layer: an exemption a layer declared for a step\nstill on an unmerged branch matched nothing CI ran on the next re-pin\n(`qa:publish --add`, 2026-10-14), and `gates-workflows.test.ts` refuses a stale\nexemption as it refuses an unclassified step.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-17",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "`index.lock.json`, and the legacy name",
      "prov:value": "It was\n`<root-instance>.mount-lock.json` until 2026-10-07. The rules for each reader\nand writer:",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-10-07"
      ],
      "dcterms:date": [
        "2026-10-07"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-18",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "The reserved `index` stem",
      "prov:value": "It is the one root scan, and\n  the five scripts that re-implemented it now call it or\n  `instantiatedHarnessNames`."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/index-config.md#provenance-19",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "END index mounts",
      "prov:value": "`check:index-ignores` fails when the block is missing or disagrees with the\nindex. When an index exists, `mount:remote` **no longer appends to\n`.git/info/exclude`**."
    }
  ]
